<title>USA: BOXING-JONES STOPS BRANNON TO RETAIN IBF TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-JONES STOPS BRANNON TO RETAIN IBF TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roy Jones Jr kept his International Boxing Federation super middleweight title when the referee stopped his fight with fellow-American Bryant Brannon at 2:23 of the second round on Friday.</p>
</text>
